4	 * This file is intentionally NOT a collection of static string assertions on
5	 * source code (the previous version of `app.test.js` was — see audit_report-1
6	 * §215-217 and audit_report-2 §189-191). Instead, every test imports the real
7	 * production module from `../frontend/js/...` and exercises actual runtime
8	 * behavior:
9	 *
