11	 *   - Auth-service setup → login → register flow (real DB + real crypto)
12	 *   - Permissions service: create / consume / orphan-reservation fail-closed
13	 *   - Rate-limit enforcement against real audit-log counters
14	 *   - Pure lib modules (auth, permissions, content, notification, device, map, audit)
15	 *
16	 * Globals (`indexedDB`, `localStorage`, `crypto`) are shimmed in-process via
17	 * the in-memory mocks under `../unit_tests/indexeddb-mock.js`.
